OL,3,GNEWSAPrinces Street to reopen seven
OL,4,Aweeks after building fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FEdinburgh's Princes Street is to fully
OL,7,Freopen on Saturday, seven weeks after a
OL,8,Fmajor fire at a former department
OL,9,Fstore.
OL,11,FThe thoroughfare was partially closed
OL,12,Ffor almost the entirety of the city's
OL,13,Ffestival season after the blaze at the
OL,14,FB-listed former Debenhams in the early
OL,15,Fhours of 9 July.
OL,17,FBus routes were diverted away from the
OL,18,Farea and tram services were only
OL,19,Foperating in the west of the city while
OL,20,Fwork to make the remainder of the
OL,21,Fbuilding safe was ongoing.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
