OL,3,GNEWSAPrinces Street to reopen seven
OL,4,Aweeks after building fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FCity of Edinburgh Council said "several
OL,7,Ftonnes" of debris had been removed from
OL,8,Fthe site, and tram links would resume
OL,9,Fsubject to "testing" on Friday.
